---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { treks } from '../data/treksData.js';
import { trekFAQs } from "../data/faqsData.js";
import NewsBanner from "../components/NewsBanner.jsx";
import NewsSection from "../components/NewsSection.jsx";
import "../styles/global.css";
---


<Layout title="Planethimalayas">

<!-- Top banner -->
<div class="banner-wrapper">
  <NewsBanner client:load />
</div>

<!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="hero"> 
    <div> 
      <h1>More Than Just A Trek</h1> 
    </div> 
    <div> 
      <a href="/upcoming-treks" class="cta-button underline-hover">Upcoming Treks</a> </div> <div> <p>"Join our treks, thoughtfully crafted for deeply personal mountain experiences with unwavering focus on individual care, safety, and a genuine love for the Himalayas"</p> 
    </div> 
  </section>

<div class="container">
<!-- Testimonials Section -->
<section class="testimonials">
  <h2 class="testimonials-heading">What our trekkers say</h2>
  <div class="section-underline"></div>

  <!-- Wrapper to hold arrows + cards -->
  <div class="testimonials-wrapper" style="position: relative;">
    <!-- Left Arrow -->
    <button class="scroll-btn left" onclick="scrollTestimonials(-1)">&#10094;</button>
    <!-- Right Arrow -->
    <button class="scroll-btn right" onclick="scrollTestimonials(1)">&#10095;</button>

    <!-- Card Container -->
    <div class="testimonials-card-wrapper" id="testimonialRow">
      
      <!-- Testimonial Card 1 -->
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-header">
          <img src="/images/main/samar.jpeg" alt="Samar" class="testimonial-pic" />
          <div class="testimonial-info">
            <h3 class="testimonial-name">Samar</h3>
            <p class="testimonial-profession">Automotive UX Designer | Pune</p>
            <div class="testimonial-social">
              <a href="https://instagram.com/wheelspin_199" target="_blank">
                <i class="fab fa-instagram"></i> @wheelspin_199
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial-stars">★★★★★</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">
          I made friendship with the mountains through Kamal sirs experience. The moment i met him at my last trek at Kedarkantha, I was impressed by his mountaineering knowledge and friendly nature that this year too (to Tungnath) and every year hereafter I am going to partner him to a new peak and new experiences in those journeys. Kudos to Planethimalayas for the exceptional work in making the love of mountains more accessible and enjoyable.
        </p>
        <button class="read-more-btn">Read More</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial Card 2 -->
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-header">
          <img src="/images/main/jytte.png" alt="Jytte" class="testimonial-pic" />
          <div class="testimonial-info">
            <h3 class="testimonial-name">Jytte Scheepens</h3>
            <p class="testimonial-profession">Freelancer | Breda, Netherlands</p>
            <div class="testimonial-social">
              <a href="https://instagram.com/flowofjytte" target="_blank">
                <i class="fab fa-instagram"></i> @flowofjytte
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial-stars">★★★★★</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">
        I did the Kashmir Great Lakes trek with kamal. This was such an unforgettable experience. Kamal is such an amazing guide. He told us so many interesting facts, I had beautiful deep talks with him about the mountains and listened to many of his stories about the experiences he's had while trekking. he's such a genuine and pure soul. I was the only female in the team, but not once I felt uncomfortable or left out. Everyone was increrdibly respectful and nice. We were allowed to walk on our own pace and didn't feel rushed or pushed. Everone can do the trek as they want, in the way they want. He respects you and really goes out of his way to make you enjoy the most. Till this day he's still a dear friend of mine and I hope to have the priviledge to go to the mountains again, together with him. If you're planning to do a trek, definitely do it with Kamal, he a 100% will make sure this trip is something you'll never forget about.
        </p>
        <button class="read-more-btn">Read More</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial Card 3 -->
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-header">
          <img src="/images/main/clare.jpg" alt="Clare" class="testimonial-pic" />
          <div class="testimonial-info">
            <h3 class="testimonial-name">Clare Fisher</h3>
            <p class="testimonial-profession">Marketing | Canada</p>
            <div class="testimonial-social">
              <a href="https://instagram.com/clare.fisher" target="_blank">
                <i class="fab fa-instagram"></i> @clare.fisher
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial-stars">★★★★★</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">
          I had some nerves about going on a trek solo but Kamal took excellent care of me and made sure I felt safe and looked after. He was able to customize the trek to my needs and we went on lots of side quests to explore the area. Kamal is very knowledgable and has some fantastic stories to tell, so was the best company the entire time – it felt like I had friends adventuring with me! Thanks again :)
        </p>
        <button class="read-more-btn">Read More</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial Card 4 -->
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-header">
          <img src="/images/main/akshata.jpg" alt="Akshata" class="testimonial-pic" />
          <div class="testimonial-info">
            <h3 class="testimonial-name">Akshata Poojari</h3>
            <p class="testimonial-profession">Bangalore</p>
            <div class="testimonial-social">
              <a href="https://instagram.com/akshata_r_poojari" target="_blank">
                <i class="fab fa-instagram"></i> @akshata_r_poojari
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial-stars">★★★★★</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">
          The trekking experience was absolutely unforgettable..Our guide was friendly and knowledgeable, making the whole journey fun and safe.
        </p>
        <button class="read-more-btn">Read More</button>
      </div>
    </div> <!-- /#testimonialRow -->
  </div> <!-- /.testimonials-wrapper -->
</section> <!-- /.testimonials -->

<!-- UPCOMING TREKS: Winter Treks -->
<section class="trek-section">
  <h2>Upcoming Treks</h2>
  <div class="section-underline"></div>
  <div class="trek-cards-wrapper">
    <button class="scroll-btn left" onclick="scrollCards('winter', -1)">&lt;</button>
    <div class="trek-cards-scroll" id="winter">
      {
        treks
          .filter(trek => Array.isArray(trek.season) && trek.season.map(s => s.toLowerCase()).includes('winter'))
          .map(trek => {
            const duration = trek.overview?.facts?.find(f => f.label === "Trek Duration")?.value || trek.duration;
            const difficultyStr = Array.isArray(trek.difficulty) ? trek.difficulty.join(', ') : trek.difficulty;
            return (
              <div class="trek-card" key={trek.id}>
                <a href={`/trek/${trek.id}#trek-hero`}>
                  <img src={trek.heroImage} alt={`View of ${trek.name} trek`} loading="lazy" />
                </a>
                <h3 class="trek-name">{trek.name}</h3>
                <div class="trek-info">{duration} | {trek.region}</div>
                <div class="trek-difficulty">{difficultyStr}</div>
                <div class="trek-buttons">
                  <a href={`/trek/${trek.id}#highlights`} class="btn btn-details">View Details</a>
                  <a href={`/trek/${trek.id}#pricing-snippet-wrapper`} class="btn btn-dates">View Dates</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            );
          })
      }
    </div>
    <button class="scroll-btn right" onclick="scrollCards('winter', 1)">&gt;</button>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- News Section -->
<section class="news-section">
  <h2 class="news-section-heading">News & Articles</h2>
  <div class="section-underline"></div>
  <NewsSection client:load />
</section>

<!-- Faqs Section -->
<section class="faqs-section">
    <h2 class="faqs-section-heading">FAQs</h2>
    <div class="section-underline"></div>

    <!-- FAQ topics -->
    {trekFAQs.map((topicBlock, topicIndex) => (
      <div class="faq-topic" data-topic-index={topicIndex}>
        <div class="faq-topic-header" role="button" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="topic-toggle">▶</span>
          <h3>{topicBlock.topic}</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-topic-body" data-open="false" aria-hidden="true" style="display:none;">
          {topicBlock.faqs.map((faq, faqIndex) => (
            <div class="faq-item" data-faq-index={faqIndex}>
              <div class="faq-question" role="button" aria-expanded="false">
                <span class="faq-toggle">&gt;</span>
                <span set:html={faq.question}></span>
              </div>
              <div class="faq-answer" set:html={faq.answer} hidden></div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}

    <!-- Link to full FAQs page -->
    <div class="faq-footer">
      <a href="/faqs" target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>Search FAQs →</a>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="about-section">
  <h2 class="about-heading">How our treks are more than just a trek</h2>
  <div class="section-underline"></div>

  <!-- First card -->
  <div class="about-card trek-icon">
    <h3 class="about-subheading">Not Just a Trek — A Journey That Stays With You</h3>
    <p class="about-text">
      Every trail we walk is a carefully chosen path into the heart of the Himalayas — not just to witness their grandeur, but to feel them under your skin and soul. Our treks are designed not as bucket list checkmarks, but as life-affirming journeys, where the silence of alpine forests, the crackle of campfire stories, and the first glimpse of dawn over snow peaks transform the ordinary into something unforgettable. At Planethimalayas, we believe a mountain journey is deeply personal — and that belief runs through everything we do.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Second card -->
  <div class="about-card care-icon">
    <h3 class="about-subheading">Individual Care, Every Step of the Way</h3>
    <p class="about-text">
      We keep our groups small and intimate so we can focus on you — your pace, your concerns, your joy. From pre-trek guidance to trail-side support, our experienced trek leaders walk with intention, offering safety without compromise and attention without intrusion. Whether you're a first-time trekker or a seasoned explorer, our team ensures you feel held, heard, and never hurried. It’s this deep care that turns strangers into friends and walks into memories.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Third card -->
  <div class="about-card love-icon">
    <h3 class="about-subheading">Built on Genuine Love for the Himalayas</h3>
    <p class="about-text">
      We don’t just operate in the Himalayas — we live and breathe them. From respecting mountain communities to following Leave No Trace ethics, our treks are shaped by a love that’s humble, local, and real. Our itineraries blend raw beauty with responsible travel, ensuring you not only see these mountains — but truly connect with them. With Planethimalayas, your trek becomes more than a trip — it becomes part of your story.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>


<style>

.banner-wrapper {
  width: 100%;
  height: 30px;
  position: absolute;   /* pulls it out of flow */
  top: 110px;           /* two navbars stacked (55px each) */
  z-index: 90;          /* above hero but below navbars */
  background: transparent;
  overflow: hidden;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .banner-wrapper {
    top: 55px; /* only one navbar in mobile */
  }
}

.hero {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100vh; /* full viewport height */
  background-image: url('/images/main/experience-hero4.jpg');
  background-size: cover;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
  background-position: center 10%;
  color: white;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center; /* vertical centering */
  align-items: center;     /* horizontal centering */
  text-align: center;      /* center text inside */
  box-sizing: border-box;
  padding: 2rem; /* uniform padding */
  overflow: hidden; /* ensures overlay stays inside */
}

/* ✅ Add subtle overlay for better readability */
.hero::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); /* adjust transparency (0.3–0.5 recommended) */
  z-index: 1;
}

/* ✅ Make sure all hero text appears above overlay */
.hero * {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;
  font-size: 5rem;
  line-height: 1.2;
  font-weight: bold;
  color: white;
  margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
  text-shadow:
    3px 3px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7),
    6px 6px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
    0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
}

.hero p {
  font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  max-width: 800px;
  margin-top: 1rem;
  color: white;
  text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7),
    4px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
    0 0 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
}

.cta-button {
  background-color: #ff7300;
  color: black;
  font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
  font-weight: 700;
  padding: 0.5rem 3rem;
  font-size: 1rem;
  border-radius: 10px;
  width: fit-content;
  text-decoration: none;
  box-shadow: 2px 8px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8),
    0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
}

.underline-hover {
  position: relative;
  display: inline-block;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.underline-hover::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  bottom: -2px;
  left: 0;
  height: 2px;
  width: 0%;
  background-color: #ffffff; /* or #ff7300 for brand orange */
  transition: width 0.3s ease;
}

.underline-hover:hover::after {
  width: 100%;
}

.how-different {
  padding: 4rem 2rem;
}

.hero + * {
  margin-top: 2rem; /* reasonable gap between hero and next section */
}

  /* ====== Responsive Mobile Styles ====== */
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
  .hero {
    height: 60vh; /* shorter hero on mobile */
    background-position: 15% top; /* adjust image placement here */
    margin-top: -55px;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
  }

  .hero p {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-button {
    padding: 0.5rem 2rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

.underline-hover {
  position: relative;
  display: inline-block;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.underline-hover::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  bottom: -2px;
  left: 0;
  height: 2px;
  width: 0%;
  background-color: #ffffff; /* or #ff7300 for brand orange */
  transition: width 0.3s ease;
}

.underline-hover:hover::after {
  width: 100%;
}

.how-different {
  padding: 4rem 2rem;
}
  }    
  

    /* Testimonials Section - matching About Section style */
.testimonials {
  background-color: white;
  position: relative;
}

.testimonials-heading {
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-family: 'Helvetica', sans-serif;
  text-align: left;
}



/* Card wrapper */
.testimonials-card-wrapper {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1.5rem;
  overflow-x: auto;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
  padding-bottom: 10px;
  scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
}

.::-webkit-scrollbar {
  height: 8px;
}
.::-scrollbar-thumb {
  background-color: #ff7300;
  border-radius: 4px;
}
.::-scrollbar-track {
  background: #f0f0f0;
}

/* Individual cards */
.testimonial-card {
  flex: 0 0 50%; /* 2 cards per screen on desktop */
  max-width: 50%;
  scroll-snap-align: start;
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 12px;
  box-shadow: 2px 6px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  padding: 2rem;
}

.testimonial-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.testimonial-pic {
  width: 60px;
  height: 60px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  object-fit: cover;
  margin-right: 15px;
}

.testimonial-info {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.testimonial-name {
  font-weight: bold;
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 1rem;
}

.testimonial-profession,
.testimonial-social {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: #666;
  margin: 2px 0;
}

.testimonial-stars {
  color: #ff7300;
  font-size: 1rem;
}

.testimonial-text {
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
  overflow: hidden;
  max-height: 60px;
  transition: max-height 0.3s ease;
}

.testimonial-card.expanded .testimonial-text {
  max-height: 500px;
}

.read-more-btn {
  background: none;
  border: none;
  color: #ff7300;
  cursor: pointer;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
  align-self: flex-start;
  font-weight: bold;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  padding: 0;
}

/* Scrollbar styling */

/* 2. Arrow buttons */
/* Scroll buttons (lightweight arrows) */
.scroll-btn {
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  width: 30px;   /* smaller width */
  height: 30px;  /* smaller height */
  border: none;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); /* semi-transparent */
  color: #ff7300;
  font-size: 18px; /* arrow size */
  font-weight: bold;
  border-radius: 50%;
  cursor: pointer;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  z-index: 10;   /* above cards but lightweight */
  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  transition: background 0.3s;
}

.scroll-btn:hover {
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
}

.scroll-btn.left {
  left: -15px;   /* slightly outside container so it doesn’t cover content */
}

.scroll-btn.right {
  right: -15px;  /* slightly outside container */
}

/* Optional: disable outline on focus */
.scroll-btn:focus {
  outline: none;
}

/* 3. Social icons */
.testimonial-social a {
  margin-right: 0.5rem;
  color: #E1306C;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 1rem;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.3rem;
  transition: color 0.3s ease;
}

.testimonial-social a:hover {
  color: #ff7300;
}

/* Responsive adjustments */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .testimonial-card {
    flex: 0 0 100%;   /* 1 per view on mobile */
    max-width: 100%;
  }
}

.trek-section {
  margin-bottom: 2rem;

}
.trek-section h2 {
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-family: 'Helvetica', sans-serif;
  color: black;
  
}

/* Wrapper for scroll + buttons */
.trek-cards-wrapper {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
}

/* Horizontal scroll container */
.trek-cards-scroll {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1rem;
  overflow-x: auto;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
  padding: 1rem 0;
  scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
}

/* Individual card */
.trek-card {
  flex: 0 0 33.333%;  /* 3 per row desktop */
  scroll-snap-align: start;
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 8px;
  box-shadow: 
    0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),        /* subtle base shadow */
    0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);       /* deeper shadow for depth */
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  overflow: hidden;
  min-width: 0;
  transition: 
    transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), 
    box-shadow 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    will-change: transform, box-shadow;
}

  .trek-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-14px) rotateX(4deg) rotateY(2deg);
    box-shadow: 
    0 12px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25), 
    0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    z-index: 10;
  }

/* Mobile: 2 per row */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .trek-card {
    flex: 0 0 100%;
  }
}

/* Card image */
.trek-card img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 160px;
  object-fit: cover;
  transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    will-change: transform;
}

.trek-card:hover img {
    transform: scale(1.25) rotate(-1deg);
}

/* Card text */
.trek-name {
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  color: #ff7300;
  text-align: center;
  margin: 0.5rem 0;
  text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

.trek-info, .trek-difficulty {
  text-align: center;
  margin: 0 0.5rem 0.5rem;
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: black;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: capitalize;
}

/* Buttons container */
.trek-buttons {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

/* Buttons */
.trek-card a.btn {
  padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  border-radius: 4px;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
  border: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  border: 2px solid transparent;
}

.btn-details {
  background: black;
  color: white;
  box-shadow: 0px 2px 8px #ff7300;
}

.btn-details:hover {
  background: #ff7300;
  color: black;
  box-shadow: 0px 2px 8px black;
}

.btn-dates {
  background: #ff7300;
  color: black;
  box-shadow: 0px 2px 8px black;
}

.btn-dates:hover {
  background: black;
  color: white;
  box-shadow: 0px 2px 8px #ff7300;
}

.news-section {
  background-color: white;
  position: relative;
}

.news-section-heading {
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-family: 'Helvetica', sans-serif;
  text-align: left;
}

/* About Section */
.about-section {
  background-color: white;
  position: relative;
}

.about-heading {
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-family: 'Helvetica', sans-serif;
  text-align: left;
}

.section-underline {
  height: 2px;
  background-color: var(--brand-color, #ff7300);
  width: 100%;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  border-radius: 2px;
}

/* About cards */
.about-card {
  background-color: #fff;
  border-radius: 1rem;
  padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  box-shadow: 2px 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); /* smoother shadow */
  position: relative; /* for background icon */
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* Background icons for about cards */
.about-card::before {
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%; /* center horizontally on mobile */
  top: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  font-size: clamp(6rem, 5vw, 8rem); /* responsive size */
  background: linear-gradient(
    rgba(255, 115, 0, 0.2),   /* top: stronger */
    rgba(255, 115, 0, 0.12)   /* bottom: lighter */
  );
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;

  /* soft glow for better visibility */
  text-shadow: 2px 2px 6px rgba(255, 115, 0, 0.15);
  z-index: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
